I have installed PL8 and to my surprise the screen is not correctly updated :-(
When using the uppercase move commands (like H,J,K,L) only the start and end
positions are shown. The hallway in between is not shown. I need an explicit
screen redraw command (^R) to get me the complete hallway & forks. Same things
happen when I enter a room: only the special things are shown. After a ^R
the whole room is shown. Also when I open a door the symbol of a closed door
(+) is not changed to an open door (- or |) until a screen redraw or when I
go through the door. Does anyone know what is wrong ? I am using TERMINFO
and libcurses, but this seemed to be working correctly for all previous PL's.

Example:

    #@#

Typing: L

New display:                    .     {
                                    $
    ###                         @       +


                                ---------
After ^R display:               ......{.|
          ####                  |...$...|
    ############################@.......+
               ####      #      ---------
                                         
Needless to say I am not blind in the game (and real life :-).
